{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Will roar</b> — a parable. Is it the lion's habit to roar only over its prey, and I have roared for nothing?! Furthermore: have you seen a lion that rose from its lair, giving voice over its prey — that it could escape from its hand, since its fear paralyzes it? If so, how will you escape from my decree?!"], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:17:53.968544150Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}